sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor D as Dentist
  participant UI as Examination Screen
  participant S as ExaminationService
  participant F as ExaminationFeeService
  participant DB as Database
  D ->> UI : finish visit, confirm work reviewed, choose fee
  UI ->> S : completeVisit(visit, feeChoice)
  activate S
  S ->> S : check access, duplicate request, version
  S ->> S : examination confirmed and work reviewed?
  S ->> DB : any clinical activity still in draft?
  S ->> DB : investigations reviewed and billed ones performed?
  S ->> S : diagnosis and disposition present?
  alt any check fails
  S -->> UI : reject, nothing is saved
  else all checks pass
  S ->> F : recordExaminationFee(visit, feeChoice)
  activate F
  F ->> DB : create examination fee record
  F -->> S : fee recorded
  deactivate F
  S ->> DB : visit and appointment -> Completed
  S ->> DB : save audit log and request record
  S -->> UI : updated visit
  end
  deactivate S
